# Guide of Souls' attack trigger makes its target "an Angel in addition to its other types". Artificial Evolution changes
# the text of Bot1's Guide of Souls, Angel to Elf (CR 612.1), so the attacking creature it puts counters on becomes an
# Elf, not an Angel (CR 612). Three Ornithopters entering bank the three energy counters it spends.

